{"id":"ceb42112e28c7ff5","group":"58","path":"58/batch07/58-df-zfc-topo9-sequential-space.md","title":"ZFC Topo9 Sequential Space","display":"df-zfc-topo9-sequential-space — ZFC Topo9 Sequential Space","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Set Theory","book_abbrev":"58","label":"58-df-zfc-topo9-sequential-space","aliases":["58-df-zfc-topo9-sequential-space"],"display":"df-zfc-topo9-sequential-space — ZFC Topo9 Sequential Space","depends_on":["[[../batch10/58-df-zfc-top5-topological-space.md]]","[[../batch04/58-df-zfc-top-convergence-sequence.md]]","[[../batch12/58-df-zfc-top5-closed-set.md]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Set Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"58"},{"key":"label","html":"58-df-zfc-topo9-sequential-space"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>58-df-zfc-topo9-sequential-space</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-zfc-topo9-sequential-space — ZFC Topo9 Sequential Space"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"74086485fba8d86f\" href=\"?note=74086485fba8d86f\" title=\"../batch10/58-df-zfc-top5-topological-space.md\">../batch10/58-df-zfc-top5-topological-space.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"91dfddd12189e300\" href=\"?note=91dfddd12189e300\" title=\"../batch04/58-df-zfc-top-convergence-sequence.md\">../batch04/58-df-zfc-top-convergence-sequence.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"4dc8b2d2e69010a2\" href=\"?note=4dc8b2d2e69010a2\" title=\"../batch12/58-df-zfc-top5-closed-set.md\">../batch12/58-df-zfc-top5-closed-set.md</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"X,\\tau,A,x,s\\in V\">\\(X,\\tau,A,x,s\\in V\\)</span></li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ZfcTop5TopologicalSpace}_S\">\\(\\mathrm{ZfcTop5TopologicalSpace}_S\\)</span> (topological-space predicate, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"74086485fba8d86f\" href=\"?note=74086485fba8d86f\" title=\"../batch10/58-df-zfc-top5-topological-space.md\">../batch10/58-df-zfc-top5-topological-space.md</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ZfcTopConvergenceSequence}_S\">\\(\\mathrm{ZfcTopConvergenceSequence}_S\\)</span> (sequence-convergence predicate, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"91dfddd12189e300\" href=\"?note=91dfddd12189e300\" title=\"../batch04/58-df-zfc-top-convergence-sequence.md\">../batch04/58-df-zfc-top-convergence-sequence.md</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ZfcTop5ClosedSet}_S\">\\(\\mathrm{ZfcTop5ClosedSet}_S\\)</span> (closed-set predicate, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"4dc8b2d2e69010a2\" href=\"?note=4dc8b2d2e69010a2\" title=\"../batch12/58-df-zfc-top5-closed-set.md\">../batch12/58-df-zfc-top5-closed-set.md</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ZfcTopo9SequentialSpace}_S\">\\(\\mathrm{ZfcTopo9SequentialSpace}_S\\)</span> (predicate defined here)</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\begin{aligned}\n&amp;\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}topo9\\text{-}sequential\\text{-}space}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{ZfcTopo9SequentialSpace}_S(X,\\tau)\\\\\n&amp;\\quad\\leftrightarrow\n\\mathrm{ZfcTop5TopologicalSpace}_S(X,\\tau)\n\\land\\forall A\\subseteq X\\;\n\\Bigl(\n\\bigl[\\forall s\\in A^\\omega\\;\n\\forall x\\in X\\;(\\mathrm{ZfcTopConvergenceSequence}_S(s,x,X,\\tau)\\to x\\in A)\\bigr]\\\\\n&amp;\\hspace{44mm}\\to \\mathrm{ZfcTop5ClosedSet}_S(X,\\tau,A)\n\\Bigr).\n\\end{aligned}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\begin{aligned}\n&amp;\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}topo9\\text{-}sequential\\text{-}space}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{ZfcTopo9SequentialSpace}_S(X,\\tau)\\\\\n&amp;\\quad\\leftrightarrow\n\\mathrm{ZfcTop5TopologicalSpace}_S(X,\\tau)\n\\land\\forall A\\subseteq X\\;\n\\Bigl(\n\\bigl[\\forall s\\in A^\\omega\\;\n\\forall x\\in X\\;(\\mathrm{ZfcTopConvergenceSequence}_S(s,x,X,\\tau)\\to x\\in A)\\bigr]\\\\\n&amp;\\hspace{44mm}\\to \\mathrm{ZfcTop5ClosedSet}_S(X,\\tau,A)\n\\Bigr).\n\\end{aligned}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>Thus every sequentially closed subset is closed. Requiring every closure point of <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A\">\\(A\\)</span> to be the limit of a sequence from <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A\">\\(A\\)</span> would instead define the stronger Fréchet--Urysohn property.</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"../batch10/58-df-zfc-top5-topological-space.md","status":"resolved","id":"74086485fba8d86f","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch10/58-df-zfc-top5-topological-space.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch04/58-df-zfc-top-convergence-sequence.md","status":"resolved","id":"91dfddd12189e300","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch04/58-df-zfc-top-convergence-sequence.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch12/58-df-zfc-top5-closed-set.md","status":"resolved","id":"4dc8b2d2e69010a2","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch12/58-df-zfc-top5-closed-set.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch10/58-df-zfc-top5-topological-space.md","status":"resolved","id":"74086485fba8d86f","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{ZfcTop5TopologicalSpace}_S$ (topological-space predicate, see [[../batch10/58-df-zfc-top5-topological-space.md]])","embed":false},{"target":"../batch04/58-df-zfc-top-convergence-sequence.md","status":"resolved","id":"91dfddd12189e300","anchor":"ref-5","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{ZfcTopConvergenceSequence}_S$ (sequence-convergence predicate, see [[../batch04/58-df-zfc-top-convergence-sequence.md]])","embed":false},{"target":"../batch12/58-df-zfc-top5-closed-set.md","status":"resolved","id":"4dc8b2d2e69010a2","anchor":"ref-6","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{ZfcTop5ClosedSet}_S$ (closed-set predicate, see [[../batch12/58-df-zfc-top5-closed-set.md]])","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"X,\\tau,A,x,s\\in V","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{ZfcTop5TopologicalSpace}_S","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{ZfcTopConvergenceSequence}_S","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{ZfcTop5ClosedSet}_S","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{ZfcTopo9SequentialSpace}_S","display":false},{"tex":"\\begin{aligned}\n&\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}topo9\\text{-}sequential\\text{-}space}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{ZfcTopo9SequentialSpace}_S(X,\\tau)\\\\\n&\\quad\\leftrightarrow\n\\mathrm{ZfcTop5TopologicalSpace}_S(X,\\tau)\n\\land\\forall A\\subseteq X\\;\n\\Bigl(\n\\bigl[\\forall s\\in A^\\omega\\;\n\\forall x\\in X\\;(\\mathrm{ZfcTopConvergenceSequence}_S(s,x,X,\\tau)\\to x\\in A)\\bigr]\\\\\n&\\hspace{44mm}\\to \\mathrm{ZfcTop5ClosedSet}_S(X,\\tau,A)\n\\Bigr).\n\\end{aligned}","display":true},{"tex":"A","display":false},{"tex":"A","display":false}],"bytes":1579,"backlinks":[{"id":"84daad544872cc71","anchor":"ref-3740","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[../batch07/58-df-zfc-topo9-sequential-space.md|58-df-zfc-topo9-sequential-space]]（batch07）"}],"outgoing":["74086485fba8d86f","91dfddd12189e300","4dc8b2d2e69010a2"]}